## Shared Folder

A shared folder was created for the Finance department.

The folder was shared over the network using SMB and configured so that only authorised users could access it.

---

## Permissions

Permissions were assigned to the **finance-team** security group rather than individual user accounts.

Permission types configured:

- Share Permissions
- NTFS Permissions

This allows members of the **finance-team** group to access the shared folder while preventing unauthorised users from viewing or modifying its contents.

